      "rule": "repeat-tool-calls",
      "category": "context-bloat",
      "title": "2 redundant re-reads of content already in context",
      "detail": "The same file or search was fetched again in the same context, with nothing edited in between. Re-reads after an edit, after a compaction, or by a subagent are not counted. Each duplicate re-enters the cacheable prefix and is re-read by every later call, so the cost compounds with context length.",
      "why": "A repeat is written into the conversation again and re-read by every later call, so it keeps costing until the conversation ends or is compacted.",
      "tier": "fix",
      "savings": {
        "currentUsd": 0.00044399999999999995,
        "windowUsd": 0.000025679999999999998,
        "monthlyUsd": 0.0007704,
